<title>ITALY: SOCCER-ITALIAN FIRST DIVISION SUMMARIES.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-ITALIAN FIRST DIVISION SUMMARIES.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1996-09-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Summaries of Italian first division</p>
<p>soccer matches played on Saturday:</p>
<p>Bologna 1 (Fontolan 35th minute) Lazio 0. Halftime 1-0.</p>
<p>Attendance: 35,000</p>
<p>Parma 3 (Baggio 14, Chiesa 22, Zola 87) Napoli 0. 2-0. 26,000</p>
<p>Roma 3 (Aldair 13, Balbo 38, Fonseca 72) Piacenza 1 (Luiso 49 -</p>
<p>penalty). 2-0. 53,000</p>
<p>Udinese 0 Inter 1 (Sforza 8). 0-1. 30,000</p>
